{"id":"d5d65b2fd44760f8","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination.md","title":"RCF has Quantifier Elimination","display":"thm-rcf-qe — RCF has Quantifier Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination","aliases":["57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination"],"display":"thm-rcf-qe — RCF has Quantifier Elimination","depends_on":["[[57-df-rcf]]","[[57-df-quantifier-free]]","[[57-df-field]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-rcf-quantifier-elimination</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rcf-qe — RCF has Quantifier Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a1792a4c383672b\" href=\"?note=9a1792a4c383672b\" title=\"57-df-rcf\">57-df-rcf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"RCF-has-Quantifier-Elimination\">RCF has Quantifier Elimination</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ring}}\\)</span> 保持 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"be21afa871789456\" href=\"?note=be21afa871789456\" title=\"57-df-field\">57-df-field</a> 的原语言（其中没有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^&lt;\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^&lt;\\)</span> 是其加入一个新二元关系符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 的扩展，其他符号分区保持不变。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R\">\\(\\mathfrak R\\)</span> 是环语言结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_R\\subseteq R^2\">\\(&lt;_R\\subseteq R^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=|\\mathfrak R|\">\\(R=|\\mathfrak R|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak R^&lt;\">\\(\\mathfrak R^&lt;\\)</span> 为把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span> 解释为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_R\">\\(&lt;_R\\)</span> 的同载体扩张。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}\">\\(\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9a1792a4c383672b\" href=\"?note=9a1792a4c383672b\" title=\"57-df-rcf\">57-df-rcf</a>，不把原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCF}\">\\(\\mathrm{RCF}\\)</span> 谓词替换成它。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^&lt;}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^&lt;}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}\">\\(\\mathrm{QF}\\)</span> 与满足取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6e2653d41c62cb0e\" href=\"?note=6e2653d41c62cb0e\" title=\"57-df-quantifier-free\">57-df-quantifier-free</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Exp}_{&lt;}(\\mathfrak R,r)\\coloneqq\\langle|\\mathfrak R|,\\pi_2(\\mathfrak R)\\cup\\{\\langle&lt;,r\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\quad(r\\subseteq|\\mathfrak R|^2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Exp}_{&lt;}(\\mathfrak R,r)\\coloneqq\\langle|\\mathfrak R|,\\pi_2(\\mathfrak R)\\cup\\{\\langle&lt;,r\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\quad(r\\subseteq|\\mathfrak R|^2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^&lt;}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;\\forall&lt;_R\\subseteq|\\mathfrak R|^2\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\to\\operatorname{Exp}_{&lt;}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{QF}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}^&lt;}\\;\\left[\n\\mathrm{FV}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi)\\land\n\\forall\\mathfrak R\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_{\\mathrm{ring}}}\\;\\forall&lt;_R\\subseteq|\\mathfrak R|^2\\;\n\\left(\\mathrm{RealClosedOrd}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\to\\operatorname{Exp}_{&lt;}(\\mathfrak R,&lt;_R)\\models(\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原定理不能在没有序符号的 S_ring 中成立：一元“非零平方”可定义集一般不是有限或余有限，而纯域语言的一元无量词可定义集只能是有限或余有限。修复显式发生在有序扩张上，并增加真正的有序实闭域条件；S_ring 与原 RCF 谓词均不改。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"RCF-has-Quantifier-Elimination","text":"RCF has Quantifier Elimination","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-rcf","status":"resolved","id":"9a17